  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "👕 T-Shirt Business Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Names for a tee brand or print shop, from Tee Break to The Ink Shed."
    },
    "intro": "Good t-shirt business names fit on a neck label and a social handle and hint at what you print: a tee pun, a slogan-brand name, or a plain name for a print shop. Launching a print-on-demand store, a slogan tee brand or a screen-printing shop? This **t-shirt business name generator** gives you names in seven styles, from tea puns to proper print-shop names, and you can check each one is free before you order the first run.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Eight good t-shirt business names",
        "content": "<p>All eight came from the generator:</p><ul><li><strong>Tee for Two</strong>: a pun on tea for two, warm and easy to say.</li><li><strong>Screen Time</strong>: a double meaning: screen printing, and the hours everyone spends on their phone.</li><li><strong>Plot Twist Tees</strong>: for a slogan brand with a sense of humour.</li><li><strong>Tee Hee Shirt Co.</strong>: a giggle in a name, good for funny prints.</li><li><strong>Happy Little Tees</strong>: cute and gentle, for children's and pastel designs.</li><li><strong>Studio Overdye</strong>: a dyeing term, for a cooler, minimal brand.</li><li><strong>The Press Shed</strong>: a print shop name: honest, local and a little rustic.</li><li><strong>Hampton on a Tee</strong>: a town pride brand. Put your own town in the box.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "heading": "Brand or print shop?",
